lc/virginia/tazewell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids January to February, August to September, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of them. In 2025, August to September came in at 67% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 50% of normal on the middle, and June to July came in at 132%.</p>"}
